# Flood the Engine on Bot2's Ornithopter (CR 303.4, 502.3, 613.1f): the Aura's enters trigger taps it, it loses Flying, and it stays
# tapped through Bot2's untap step (turn 2) - still holding it down after the Aura's own enters trigger has long resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Flood the Engine
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flood the Engine.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = (absent)
